# What an image is built from: the API's image (apps/api/Dockerfile) takes the Python workspace,
# the rule-set fetcher, the rule sets' pins and the corpus, and nothing else of the repository.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/api/
!packages/einvoice_core/
!scripts/fetch_rulesets.py
!third_party/
!corpus/

# Not even of those: the tests, caches, and the stylesheets compiled outside the image.
apps/api/tests
packages/einvoice_core/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
third_party/_compiled
